								<li><strong>This is grounding, not training.</strong> No weights changed. The claimed future state — an internally hosted Gemma carrying industry and firm rules at no per-token vendor cost — still has fixed infrastructure cost, and still needs this pack maintained.</li>
								<li><strong>The pack is a snapshot.</strong> It was transcribed on 2026-09-06. Exchange APIs change; a stale pack grounds the model in confident, wrong detail — worse than no pack at all.</li>
							</ul>
						</section>
					</section>
