										<details class="cc-arm">
											<summary><strong>@entry.RequestedModel</strong> &mdash; @entry.CheckablePassed of @entry.CheckableTotal compiler checks, @entry.InsightsFound of @entry.Insights.Count insights &middot; slot @entry.Slot for the judge</summary>
											@if (entry.Checks.Any(c => !c.Passed))
